WEBVTT

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:11.590
Wow!  Shrimp!

00:02:11.710 --> 00:02:14.020
Kids like shrimp, right?

00:02:14.600 --> 00:02:18.650
I made too many for Yuzu's lunch, so everyone can have some now.

00:02:24.020 --> 00:02:26.020
Now, now, don't be shy...

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:27.010
Eat up!  Eat up!

00:02:34.390 --> 00:02:36.050
Wow!

00:02:47.660 --> 00:02:50.520
It's horrible!  This is disgusting!  What's with this fried shrimp?!

00:02:51.020 --> 00:02:52.450
But, it's tempura...

00:02:52.950 --> 00:02:54.180
What do you mean it's disgusting?

00:02:54.570 --> 00:02:57.690
I don't want anything like that so early in the morning.

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:02.220
Do you always make Yuzuyu-chan eat things like this?!

00:03:02.430 --> 00:03:03.650
It's bad for her growth!

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:05.610
But, it's good!

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:06.990
How?

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.210
I said it's good so it's good!

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:10.600
That can't be!

00:03:11.030 --> 00:03:13.170
I think something is wrong with your taste buds!

00:03:16.560 --> 00:03:18.100
It makes me happy!

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:22.660
Yuzu!

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:24.020
Hey!

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:26.930
How you've accepted my love so easily...

00:03:28.120 --> 00:03:30.150
You're a good girl!  Good girl!

00:03:31.490 --> 00:03:32.730
It's better than not having any!

00:04:02.400 --> 00:04:06.090
Kokoro, you're moving today, right?

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:07.120
Yes.

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:09.650
It's only one person's things, so I'm sure you'll finish quickly.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:10.760
Yes.

00:04:12.210 --> 00:04:14.120
I'll deposit some money into your account every month.

00:04:14.700 --> 00:04:16.500
So, let me know if there's anything else you need.

00:04:16.980 --> 00:04:18.440
There's nothing... probably.

00:04:25.080 --> 00:04:28.000
I wonder if she has something against me.

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:31.850
She always seems to ignore me and never makes eye contact.

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:34.800
I don't think so.

00:04:35.210 --> 00:04:35.970
But...

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:40.100
She's always done everything by herself ever since she was little.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:42.840
She seems to be better off on her own.

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:44.780
So, there's no need for you to worry about it.

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:47.480
I hope that's true.

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:03.860
Kokoro doesn't have a mother.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.600
I made it on time!

00:05:17.580 --> 00:05:18.300
Hey!

00:05:18.820 --> 00:05:19.560
Kippei!

00:05:20.650 --> 00:05:22.420
Oh hey, Natsu.

00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:23.810
What's up?!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.250
So full of energy this early in the morning.

00:05:33.390 --> 00:05:34.350
What are you doing?

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:35.840
Basking in the sun?

00:05:36.110 --> 00:05:36.540
Yeah...

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:38.690
taking a little break.

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:40.770
Then, me too!

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:43.700
Hey, Kippei, are you doing alright?

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:46.080
Yeah, I'm fine... a bit sleepy though.

00:05:50.860 --> 00:05:54.630
I've been wanting a boyfriend lately.

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:02.810
What?  Me?

00:06:03.670 --> 00:06:04.820
Want me to be your boyfriend?

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:09.930
No way.  I don't want you as my boyfriend.

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:11.740
Oh well...

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:15.230
Kippei, I know you like girls...

00:06:16.010 --> 00:06:19.220
but even girls like to fool around with boys like you.

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:24.640
But in reality, there's a guy they're serious about.

00:06:27.030 --> 00:06:30.860
At this rate, you're going to be all alone when you die.

00:06:54.270 --> 00:06:55.250
Kokoro-chin!

00:06:57.820 --> 00:07:00.690
Listen!  Natsu is terrible!

00:07:01.330 --> 00:07:02.530
She said some scary things.

00:07:04.100 --> 00:07:05.890
Ah!  Natsu!

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:10.380
Later, Kippei!  Let's hang out again.

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:12.670
I won't hang out with you!

00:07:14.840 --> 00:07:15.370
And?

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:18.290
What?

00:07:21.870 --> 00:07:23.450
If you don't need anything, don't hold me back.

00:07:28.570 --> 00:07:31.900
At this rate, you're going to be all alone when you die.

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:37.250
It does seem like I'll be all alone.

00:07:48.240 --> 00:07:49.080
Kippei!

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:52.890
Can you go buy oil?

00:07:54.350 --> 00:07:58.300
Doesn't it seem like everyone thinks that I'm at their disposal?

00:07:58.630 --> 00:08:01.630
We're out because you used it all on the tempura this morning.

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:04.660
I'm going...

00:08:06.420 --> 00:08:08.020
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:09.440
Are you going out?

00:08:09.920 --> 00:08:11.580
Yep, I'm going shopping.

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:13.840
I want to go too!

00:08:15.530 --> 00:08:17.370
Want to get ice cream with the change then?

00:08:18.110 --> 00:08:19.300
Yay!

00:08:19.680 --> 00:08:20.580
Then go get your hat.

00:08:21.220 --> 00:08:21.720
Okay!

00:08:29.770 --> 00:08:32.170
Ice cream... Ice cream...

00:08:32.480 --> 00:08:34.650
Delicious ice cream...

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:37.120
I love ice cream!

00:08:37.690 --> 00:08:39.360
When we get home you have to brush your teeth, okay?

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:40.320
Okay!

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:43.480
Huh?

00:08:47.010 --> 00:08:48.060
It's Onee-chan.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:50.440
Huh?  Onee-chan?

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:58.000
What are you doing, Kokoro-chan?

00:08:58.270 --> 00:08:59.060
Moving.

00:08:59.290 --> 00:09:02.470
Ah, the "living alone" move?

00:09:05.350 --> 00:09:08.720
Onee-chan, your name is Kokoro-chan?  That's cute!

00:09:18.430 --> 00:09:21.250
So, Kokoro-chan, where is your place?

00:09:21.900 --> 00:09:22.440
Here.

00:09:29.130 --> 00:09:32.150
Amazing!  You're going to live here all alone?

00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:33.920
My parents are rich, so...

00:09:34.220 --> 00:09:35.360
Who would say that about themselves?

00:09:38.300 --> 00:09:39.080
Yuzuyu-chan.

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:41.510
Should we visit with her for a while?

00:09:42.030 --> 00:09:42.380
Yeah!

00:09:43.190 --> 00:09:44.210
Go home.

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:54.070
But, isn't it hard suddenly living on your own?

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:56.940
My parents are newlyweds,

00:09:57.960 --> 00:10:00.680
so I'm probably in their way.

00:10:09.390 --> 00:10:12.180
See you later.  I have some cleaning up to do.

00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:24.090
Is Onee-chan really going to live here alone?

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:25.290
Seems so.

00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:39.780
Being all alone is too lonely.

00:10:44.780 --> 00:10:48.470
It seems her dad is getting remarried.

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:51.670
Kokoro is going to have to live by herself.

00:10:52.390 --> 00:10:54.210
It's really complicated right now?

00:10:55.820 --> 00:10:56.700
What about her mom?

00:10:56.930 --> 00:10:59.340
Kokoro doesn't have a mother.

00:11:27.440 --> 00:11:30.000
Being all alone is too lonely.

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:02.650
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:05.630
What's up?

00:12:13.160 --> 00:12:15.970
I can make octopus shaped wieners now!

00:12:16.870 --> 00:12:17.410
What's wrong?

00:12:18.940 --> 00:12:23.490
I'm learning how to do origami in school right now.

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:28.570
But, I can't fold a crane well.

00:12:29.360 --> 00:12:32.400
Will you teach me how to fold a crane?

00:12:35.130 --> 00:12:36.770
That's impossible!

00:12:36.940 --> 00:12:38.510
Kippei doing origami?

00:12:38.950 --> 00:12:40.560
And, on top of that, a crane?

00:12:41.120 --> 00:12:43.810
Hey, you over there!  How insulting!

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:45.410
I can probably do it.

00:12:45.660 --> 00:12:46.450
Probably?

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:48.430
Have you made a crane before?

00:12:48.900 --> 00:12:49.480
I have!

00:12:50.690 --> 00:12:53.040
At least, I think I have.  Maybe not...

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:55.500
You don't seem very reliable.

00:12:58.850 --> 00:13:01.540
Okay then, is it okay if we do it after we get home?

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:04.060
I'll teach you how to fold a crane then.

00:13:04.510 --> 00:13:04.930
Okay!

00:13:06.030 --> 00:13:07.010
It's a promise!

00:13:08.450 --> 00:13:09.270
Pinky swear!

00:13:11.660 --> 00:13:13.600
Pinky swear,

00:13:13.730 --> 00:13:15.160
if I lie,

00:13:15.160 --> 00:13:17.890
I'll swallow 1,000 needles.

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:19.920
I promise.

00:13:19.920 --> 00:13:25.080
Kippei, since you made a promise, you have to learn how to fold origami.

00:13:25.850 --> 00:13:28.250
A promise to a child must always be kept.

00:13:28.440 --> 00:13:29.530
I know that!

00:13:29.760 --> 00:13:31.120
We pinky swore!

00:13:32.720 --> 00:13:34.020
It's already ten till!

00:13:34.350 --> 00:13:35.310
We have to hurry!

00:13:37.530 --> 00:13:39.950
I don't have socks!

00:13:42.620 --> 00:13:43.800
Ask Mom.

00:13:44.910 --> 00:13:46.660
Socks!

00:13:48.980 --> 00:13:51.040
I'm going!

00:14:00.200 --> 00:14:00.840
Kokoro!

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:02.980
Did your move go well?

00:14:03.280 --> 00:14:03.690
Yep.

00:14:04.610 --> 00:14:05.330
It's finished.

00:14:06.230 --> 00:14:07.990
I would have helped you.

00:14:08.320 --> 00:14:09.890
It's okay, I don't have much stuff.

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:12.870
Finally living on your own.

00:14:13.390 --> 00:14:15.120
Hey, can I come visit you?

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:19.110
Sure.  But, Aki, don't mess up my room.

00:14:19.430 --> 00:14:22.130
Well, of course you're going to make a mess... Right, Aki?

00:14:22.430 --> 00:14:24.450
I'll clean it up!

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:25.470
Really?

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:27.400
Really, really.

00:14:27.860 --> 00:14:31.020
Oh yeah!  Let's cook something good, okay?

00:14:31.460 --> 00:14:31.870
Sure.

00:14:32.690 --> 00:14:36.100
I'm okay with Kokoro's cooking, but I don't know about yours, Aki...

00:14:36.390 --> 00:14:37.760
What's with that?

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:39.320
Hey, hey!

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:42.520
Can't I come hang out too?

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:44.120
Absolutely not.

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.300
Why?

00:14:47.480 --> 00:14:49.760
What do you mean why?  Don't try to act like her friend.

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:52.500
There's no reason why you should be at Kokoro's house.

00:14:52.780 --> 00:14:53.770
That's mean.

00:14:53.940 --> 00:14:54.540
Cheapskate!

00:14:55.040 --> 00:14:56.950
You're too pushy.

00:15:03.710 --> 00:15:04.600
I'm going to take a nap.

00:15:05.010 --> 00:15:06.630
So, when should we make it?

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:08.280
I'm okay anytime.

00:15:08.680 --> 00:15:10.110
Then how about we make it today?

00:15:10.410 --> 00:15:11.820
What?  Today?

00:15:30.400 --> 00:15:31.790
I sweated a bit.

00:15:39.580 --> 00:15:41.060
It's 4 o'clock!

00:15:41.320 --> 00:15:42.990
I overslept!

00:15:43.360 --> 00:15:45.840
Preschool is already over!

00:15:46.070 --> 00:15:49.290
Why didn't anyone wake me up?!

00:15:55.620 --> 00:15:56.440
Kokoro-chin...

00:15:57.920 --> 00:16:00.700
You're still here?  I overslept.

00:16:01.980 --> 00:16:03.440
Oh no!

00:16:04.490 --> 00:16:06.500
I forgot I made a promise about origami.

00:16:09.370 --> 00:16:09.930
Bye!

00:16:18.230 --> 00:16:18.930
Aren't you going home?

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:21.110
I'll go home.

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:34.750
Kokoro-chan, can I ask you one thing?

00:16:35.690 --> 00:16:36.210
What?

00:16:37.730 --> 00:16:41.600
Why don't you have a mother?

00:16:45.390 --> 00:16:48.040
Nevermind.  I shouldn't have asked.

00:16:50.500 --> 00:16:53.460
She died when I was 6 years old.

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:02.250
I'm going home.

00:17:06.920 --> 00:17:07.560
Wait!

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:22.060
Sorry.

00:17:22.960 --> 00:17:24.160
Is this your family picture?

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:26.250
You're so young.

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:27.180
Don't touch it!

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:43.280
Kokoro-chan...

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:48.490
You don't really want to go home where you're going to be all alone, do you?

00:17:52.210 --> 00:17:54.780
Don't you still want to live with your family?

00:17:55.120 --> 00:17:55.850
Shut up!

00:17:57.900 --> 00:18:00.090
Being all alone is too lonely.

00:18:05.680 --> 00:18:07.090
Tell your parents!

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:10.330
Kokoro-chan, you're lonely.

00:18:10.430 --> 00:18:11.210
Shut up!

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:15.710
Shut up!  Everyone...

00:18:17.520 --> 00:18:19.560
She seems to be better off on her own.

00:18:22.770 --> 00:18:25.120
When did I ever say that I'm better off alone?

00:18:26.450 --> 00:18:30.270
Even if I'm lonely, how could I say I am...

00:18:31.890 --> 00:18:32.880
to them?

00:18:40.230 --> 00:18:41.030
Kokoro-chan.

00:18:45.280 --> 00:18:49.750
But, I was okay.

00:18:50.760 --> 00:18:53.740
And why are you making me say this now?

00:18:54.350 --> 00:18:56.700
S-Sorry.

00:18:57.520 --> 00:18:58.800
I-It'll be okay,

00:19:00.620 --> 00:19:04.940
when you come to school you have friends like Aki and Motoki.

00:19:05.760 --> 00:19:08.510
They seem to care about you a lot.

00:19:11.520 --> 00:19:12.150
And...

00:19:13.660 --> 00:19:14.360
I'm here too.

00:19:25.640 --> 00:19:26.200
No way!

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:29.200
Just because you can do it with other girls,

00:19:29.570 --> 00:19:31.350
you think you can do the same with me?

00:19:38.680 --> 00:19:44.760
If you want to be with me, then pay attention only to me.

00:19:51.190 --> 00:19:55.280
I've been thinking since a while back...

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:00.070
You like me, right?  Kokoro-chan...

00:21:08.050 --> 00:21:08.970
Yuzuyu-chan,

00:21:10.360 --> 00:21:11.550
your pick up is awfully late.

00:21:12.100 --> 00:21:12.930
That's very strange.

00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:15.580
I'll try calling your home right now.

00:21:16.590 --> 00:21:19.680
Yuzuyu-chan, while we wait, let's fold origami!

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:20.680
Okay!

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:22.840
Let's fold a crane together, everybody!

00:21:23.780 --> 00:21:25.300
Yeah, let's fold a crane.

00:21:25.740 --> 00:21:26.460
Crane?

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:31.530
Here.  You too, Yuzuyu-chan.

00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:37.000
I can't fold a crane.

00:23:57.390 --> 00:23:58.400
Yuzuyu-chan!

00:24:00.550 --> 00:24:01.960
Your pick up is here!

00:24:04.810 --> 00:24:07.210
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:24:19.270 --> 00:24:20.600
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:24:20.830 --> 00:24:22.520
Teach me how to fold a crane!

00:24:22.660 --> 00:24:23.460
Leave it to me!

00:24:23.630 --> 00:24:26.140
Do it like this right here and it's done!

00:24:26.980 --> 00:24:28.410
That's an airplane!

00:24:30.150 --> 00:24:33.210
Why didn't you pick me up today?

00:24:33.750 --> 00:24:36.160
T-That's because I was with Kokoro-chan, and...

00:24:36.290 --> 00:24:37.910
What happened with Onee-chan?

00:24:38.170 --> 00:24:39.110
Ki... Ki...

00:24:39.560 --> 00:24:40.990
Kippei-onii-chan!

00:24:42.320 --> 00:24:44.090
Next time on Aishiteruze Baby:

00:24:44.560 --> 00:24:45.460
Jealousy.

00:24:46.080 --> 00:24:47.020
What is that?
